---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import { getLocaleFromUrl, useTranslations, localizePath } from "@/lib/translations.js";

const lang = getLocaleFromUrl(Astro);
const t = useTranslations(lang);
const isEn = lang === 'en';
---

<Layout title={isEn ? "Terms of Service" : "Syarat & Ketentuan Layanan"}>
  <nav class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 mt-32 text-sm">
    <ol class="flex items-center flex-wrap gap-2 text-sm text-slate-500 py-3 border-b border-slate-100">
      <li class="flex items-center">
        <a href={localizePath('/', lang)} class="flex items-center hover:text-[#004d2c] transition-colors gap-1">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 12l2-2m0 0l7-7 7 7M5 10v10a1 1 0 001 1h3m10-11l2 2m-2-2v10a1 1 0 01-1 1h-3m-6 0a1 1 0 001-1v-4a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v4a1 1 0 001 1m-6 0h6"></path>
          </svg>
          {t('nav.home')}
        </a>
      </li>
      <li class="text-slate-300">/</li>
      <li class="text-[#004d2c] font-bold italic">
        {isEn ? 'Terms of Service' : 'Syarat & Ketentuan'}
      </li>
    </ol>
  </nav>

  <section class="py-12 bg-slate-50 min-h-screen">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      
      <!-- Header Banner -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-sm border border-slate-200/80 mb-10">
        <span class="px-4 py-1.5 bg-yellow-100 text-yellow-800 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest inline-block mb-3">
          {isEn ? "Terms & Conditions" : "Ketentuan Penggunaan Portal"}
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-[#004d2c] uppercase tracking-tight leading-tight">
          {isEn ? "Terms of Service" : "Syarat & Ketentuan Layanan"}
        </h1>
        <p class="text-slate-500 mt-3 text-sm">
          {isEn ? "Last Updated: August 2026" : "Terakhir diperbarui: Agustus 2026"}
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Terms Content -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-sm border border-slate-200/80 prose prose-slate max-w-none text-slate-700 font-light leading-relaxed">
        {isEn ? (
          <>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 border-b pb-2">1. Terms Acceptance</h2>
            <p>
              By accessing and using this website or associated digital services provided by the Department of Informatics Engineering UIN Suska Riau, you agree to comply with and be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, you should refrain from using our digital services.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 border-b pb-2 mt-8">2. Intellectual Property Rights</h2>
            <p>
              All materials, logos, content, code samples, graphics, and trademarks published on this website are the intellectual property of the Informatics Engineering Program UIN Suska Riau or its content creators, unless stated otherwise. Unauthorized reproduction, modification, or commercial distribution is strictly prohibited without prior written consent.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 border-b pb-2 mt-8">3. User Conduct & Security</h2>
            <p>Users must adhere to academic ethics and digital security guidelines when accessing our systems:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Do not attempt to compromise the integrity, security, or availability of the website servers or database APIs.</li>
              <li>Do not submit falsified information, fraudulent documents, or unauthorized content through our contact or registration forms.</li>
              <li>Students and faculty must safeguard their system credentials (passwords, access tokens) and not share them with unauthorized parties.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 border-b pb-2 mt-8">4. Service Availability & Disclaimer</h2>
            <p>
              While we strive to maintain 24/7 uptime for all academic portals, services are provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis. We reserve the right to modify, suspend, or perform scheduled maintenance on any portal service without prior notice.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 border-b pb-2 mt-8">5. Governing Law</h2>
            <p>
              These Terms of Service are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the Republic of Indonesia and institutional regulations of UIN Sultan Syarif Kasim Riau.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 border-b pb-2 mt-8">6. Contact Information</h2>
            <p>
              For inquiries regarding these terms, please contact:
            </p>
            <div class="bg-slate-50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 mt-4 not-prose">
              <p class="font-bold text-[#004d2c]">Department of Informatics Engineering</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Faculty of Science and Technology, UIN Suska Riau</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Jl. H.R. Soebrantas No. 155 Km. 15 Tuah Madani, Pekanbaru - Riau</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-2">Email: <a href="mailto:tif@uin-suska.ac.id" class="text-emerald-700 font-semibold underline">tif@uin-suska.ac.id</a></p>
            </div>
          </>
        ) : (
          <>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 border-b pb-2">1. Penerimaan Ketentuan</h2>
            <p>
              Dengan mengakses dan menggunakan portal website serta layanan digital resmi Program Studi Teknik Informatika UIN Suska Riau, Anda menyatakan setuju untuk terikat oleh Syarat dan Ketentuan Layanan ini. Jika Anda tidak menyetujui bagian mana pun dari ketentuan ini, mohon untuk tidak melanjutkan penggunaan portal digital kami.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 border-b pb-2 mt-8">2. Hak Kekayaan Intelektual</h2>
            <p>
              Seluruh konten, logo instansi, materi kuliah, gambar, desain grafik, dan kode program yang dipublikasikan pada situs web ini merupakan hak kekayaan intelektual milik Program Studi Teknik Informatika UIN Suska Riau atau pemilik lisensi terkait. Dilarang keras menggandakan, mengubah, atau mendistribusikan ulang konten tanpa izin tertulis dari pihak pengelola prodi.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 border-b pb-2 mt-8">3. Etika Penggunaan & Keamanan</h2>
            <p>Pengguna wajib mematuhi etika akademik dan aturan keselamatan digital selama beraktivitas di dalam portal:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Dilarang melakukan tindakan pemindaian ilegal (*vulnerability scanning*), peretasan, atau manipulasi data akademik pada server prodi.</li>
              <li>Dilarang mengunggah informasi palsu, dokumen tidak sah, atau materi yang melanggar hukum melalui formulir pendaftaran/kontak.</li>
              <li>Mahasiswa dan dosen bertanggung jawab penuh atas kerahasiaan kata sandi (*password*) akun masing-masing.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 border-b pb-2 mt-8">4. Ketersediaan Layanan & Penafian</h2>
            <p>
              Kami berusaha maksimal untuk memastikan kelancaran akses sistem selama 24/7. Namun, layanan disediakan sebagaimana adanya ("as is"). Pengelola berhak melakukan pemeliharaan berkala (*scheduled maintenance*) atau perubahan fitur tanpa pemberitahuan sebelumnya.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 border-b pb-2 mt-8">5. Hukum yang Berlaku</h2>
            <p>
              Syarat dan Ketentuan ini diatur dan ditafsirkan sesuai dengan hukum yang berlaku di Republik Indonesia serta peraturan tata tertib akademik UIN Sultan Syarif Kasim Riau.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 border-b pb-2 mt-8">6. Informasi Kontak</h2>
            <p>
              Apabila terdapat pertanyaan mengenai syarat dan ketentuan ini, silakan hubungi kami di:
            </p>
            <div class="bg-slate-50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 mt-4 not-prose">
              <p class="font-bold text-[#004d2c]">Program Studi Teknik Informatika</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Fakultas Sains dan Teknologi, UIN Suska Riau</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Jl. H.R. Soebrantas No. 155 Km. 15 Tuah Madani, Pekanbaru - Riau</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-2">Email: <a href="mailto:tif@uin-suska.ac.id" class="text-emerald-700 font-semibold underline">tif@uin-suska.ac.id</a></p>
            </div>
          </>
        )}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
